# Licensing

This repository contains components under two licenses:

- Files under `fonts/`, including generated CSS and WOFF2 files, are licensed
  under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. See `LICENSE-OFL.txt`.
- All other original source code and documentation in this repository are
  licensed under the MIT License. See `LICENSE-MIT.txt`.

The upstream font copyright notices in `LICENSE-OFL.txt` must remain with
redistributed font files.
